---
import InfoLayout from "../../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../data/site";
---
<InfoLayout title="Contact" description="How to reach JH Kim, the operator of Still Coding, about the services, bug reports, and privacy requests." eyebrow="STILL CODING / CONTACT" locale="en">
  <div class="info-lead"><p>Found a problem or have an idea?</p><p>Questions about Still Coding and every connected app go to the operator's email address below: bug reports, feature ideas, data corrections, and privacy requests.</p><a class="primary-link" href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <section class="info-section"><p class="section-number">01 / BEFORE YOU WRITE</p><h2>Useful context<br /><em>to include.</em></h2><ul class="info-list"><li>App name and page URL</li><li>Date, browser, and device</li><li>One–two–three steps to reproduce the issue</li><li>Error message or screenshot</li></ul></section>
  <section class="info-section"><p class="section-number">02 / OTHER CHANNELS</p><h2>Prefer to post<br /><em>in public?</em></h2><p>Portal bugs and suggestions can also be filed as a <a class="text-link" href={site.issuesUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub issue</a>. The repository is public, so send anything personal or private by email. More of the operator's work is on <a class="text-link" href={site.githubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p></section>
</InfoLayout>
